WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Step 1: The API comes with Metricool's Advanced and Custom plans. Free and Starter have no API access.

2
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Step 2: In Metricool open the menu at the top right, then Account settings.

3
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Step 3: Open the API tab.

4
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Step 4: Copy your REST API access token with Copy.

5
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Step 5: Open your brand in Metricool. The numbers after userId= and blogId= in the address are the two IDs.

6
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Step 6: In your centre, paste the token.

7
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Step 7: Paste the two numbers into userId and blogId.

8
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Step 8: Click Connect Metricool. The agent checks that the brand belongs to your account.
